{"id":945,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p></p><p>&nbsp; 为更好地宣传学校的招生政策、专业特色，吸引更多优质生源报考我校，6月24日—26日，由机械工程学院副书记李秀玲老师带队，王小龙、李红丹、边国旗老师组成招生宣传组，与经济管理学院招生宣传组前往大同同煤一中、同煤二中、口泉中学、馨茂中学、阳高一中、广灵一中等重点高中开展宣传咨询活动。</p><p>&nbsp; 宣传组团队通过现场问题解答、介绍资料发放等多元形式，向考生和家长详细介绍我校的办学特色、学科优势及招生政策，为考生筑就通往理想学府的信息桥梁，圆满完成了各驻点招生宣传工作。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3M7CB8ozUZnlnRUGlLbLRnRMRvaMRUfsMzLiozGDU4Vfnl70gihFp2hmCIa0nSyDL1hkoSh2LRvaMRC8nNMRMNUPnzCbM4fRU8lZL4G4olWFU47iLm-iM4fFLzf7M8lJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4-DL4-ZgtA8pUkcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=26328&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E62B9F070464FCC6D1E6970CCE83039B/C1522570/10D7E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3M77BDnmn2MmNDMG4Cioz-8MmQfUlLf8Mm-PMNnVoRWfU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0nSybMYyZLSysnmGZM8-DMlV2UzC4LmfRMRAfU8VVMmGsLmfFUzNaU4C4LzAFUNrRMlUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4-DL4-ZgtA8pUkcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=26328&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LR7BsLlQfU4Q2UG4T2UzCaMRUPUl-fsL7Q7nm9ZMR7YUNl0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysU1hkUSy4U4rkLRG4UzGYoRVfM8UDnRL4U8liLRlDoznFUzGbnR67nzfFLzARMRUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4-DL4-ZgtA8pUkcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=26328&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/97BBA3C5B003A0281A7D6D33CE505694/A09D7DE0/18C44\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nmnB7o7rfoz9sLGRNiMml4o7WRMmTffL8VRU4l4nmQRnN70gihFp2hmCIa0n1y4okysLkh7L8M2Ml78MRlbnzT2LRlao7MfMzUPMzCsLmrFUzl8nRAfUlMFLN7iU8-bgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PM1yYMmLYokbw62k8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=26328&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nzlBbM4Q2LllPnGzvZMmvanR9YnmNf4L8L4oRlDLNWVMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yaU1yaLkybU46kLN-aM8r2L7QRMm67LmfRU4Q7M4nfLRVFLR62nmQVM4TFLm74LmGJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4-DL4-ZgtA8pUkcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=26328&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F0B009C7B2B07EF0FC67D20CC6D74A01/07FF6E79/21320\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_